    "verdict": "CRITERION_NOT_MET: s3 vs CX3 Spearman rho = 0.305 [0.227, 0.382] at n=529 -- far below the 0.80 surrogate threshold, with a CI that excludes 0.80. Macintyre s3 and Drews CX3 share HRD-related biology but are NOT numerically interchangeable exposures; the frameworks partition copy-number features differently (s3's strongest CX correlates are negative: CX4 -0.57, CX8 -0.53).",
    "gate_c_consequence": "The CX-transfer route to Gate C is CLOSED on evidence, not on missing data. The open route is DIRECT Macintyre-framework quantification: the CINSignatureQuantification package (markowetzlab) natively supports the ovarian s1-s7 signatures, and public absolute CN profiles with clinical outcomes (TCGA-OV ASCAT SNP6 + TCGA-CDR platinum response; PCAWG-OV) require no crosswalk assumption. That is the next falsifiable experiment for Gate C."
